# Build 97d: the one-shot case $D, the Esper mansion B1's hold. B1's Esper
# (event $33, loc_E07A) on the second talk sets the event word to $D00
# and $C743 to 2; the one-shot case $D (loc_8022) is `rts`, so the word
# stays $D00 until Building_EsperMansion clears it (loc_CF0A). While it is
# set the leader stands still (loc_3786), A is ignored, and the C menu's
# gate -- `tst.b (event_flags).w` in ProcessPlayerMenu -- keeps the menu
# shut. Before 97d the port's gate read the save block's $C710 byte,
# which the port never writes (it keeps the hold apart, g_event_hold), so
# C opened the menu in the middle of the scene.
start level $11 15 14
flag $C743 1
wait idle
walk up 2
wait idle
expect level $10 16 14
walk left 3
wait idle
walk up 5
wait idle
expect level $10 13 9
press left
press a
wait idle
expect script $1698
press c
wait idle
press c
wait ticks 4
expect flag $C743 2
limit 2000
wait ticks 60                # the talk's box closed, the scene begun
state
press c                      # the C menu: shut while the hold lasts
wait ticks 30
expect menu none
shot 01_c_in_the_hold
press a
wait ticks 20
expect menu none
expect level $10 13 9
wait screen building
wait idle
expect script $190B
shot 02_lutz
